---
import type { Locale } from '../../i18n';

interface Props { locale: Locale }
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const zh = locale === 'zh';
const t = (cn: string, en: string) => zh ? cn : en;

const navItems = [
  { href: '#protocol', label: t('实验边界', 'Protocol') },
  { href: '#questions', label: t('七个问题', 'Seven questions') },
  { href: '#g2-ablation', label: t('第二代更新', 'G2 ablation') },
  { href: '#next-steps', label: t('下一步', 'Next steps') },
  { href: '#appendix', label: t('历史记录', 'History') },
] as const;
---

<header class="results-hero">
  <p class="eyebrow">{t('研究结果 · RESEARCH FINDINGS', 'OPENEVO × WEBSHOP · RESEARCH FINDINGS')}</p>
  <h1>{t('OpenEvo × WebShop 研究结果', 'OpenEvo × WebShop research findings')}</h1>
  <p class="lede">{t(
    '如果你知道实验室正在比较 OpenEvo、SEED 和 WebShop，但没有跟进每一轮实验，这一页先用普通语言讲清楚我们已经知道什么，再把专业定义、统计结果和机器证据放到对应位置。',
    'If you know the lab is comparing OpenEvo, SEED, and WebShop but have not followed every run, this page starts in plain language and then layers in technical definitions, statistical results, and machine evidence where they are needed.',
  )}</p>

  <div class="abstract-box" aria-label={t('30 秒进度摘要', '30-second progress summary')}>
    <div class="abstract-row">
      <span class="abstract-label established">{t('已经知道', 'What we know')}</span>
      <div class="abstract-copy">
        <p class="plain">{t(
          '模型从自己做成功的任务里学习一次以后，面对训练时没见过的新任务，表现确实可以变好；而且这个现象后来又复现了一次。',
          'After one update from its own successful trajectories, the model can perform better on tasks it did not see during training, and that effect was reproduced independently.',
        )}</p>
        <p class="technical"><strong>{t('专业解释：', 'Technical detail: ')}</strong>{t(
          'H1.38B 与 H1.39 支持一次参数更新后的内部新任务迁移（internal fresh task-ID-disjoint transfer）。这仍然不是 SEED 官方保留任务（held-out tasks）上的正式复现结果。',
          'H1.38B and H1.39 support one-step internal fresh task-ID-disjoint transfer after a parameter update. This is still not a formal reproduction result on the SEED official held-out tasks.',
        )}</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="abstract-row">
      <span class="abstract-label latest">{t('最新评测', 'Latest evaluation')}</span>
      <div class="abstract-copy">
        <p class="plain">{t(
          '修复“评分工具读错模型动作”的问题后，OpenEvo 看起来比基础模型做得更好一点，但现在还不能确定这个差异不是偶然波动。',
          'After fixing the action-reading problem in the measurement path, OpenEvo looks somewhat better than the base model, but the current evidence cannot yet rule out chance variation.',
        )}</p>
        <p class="technical"><strong>{t('专业解释：', 'Technical detail: ')}</strong>{t(
          '2026-08-25 的修复后主评测（repaired PRIMARY-v2）中，OpenEvo 的平均任务完成度更高，并出现少量完整成功（exact success）；但配对置信区间（paired confidence interval）仍包含 0，因此目前只能称为正向信号，不能称为稳定胜出。',
          'In the repaired PRIMARY-v2 evaluation from 2026-08-25, OpenEvo had higher average task progress and a small number of exact successes, but the paired confidence interval still includes zero. The result is therefore a positive signal, not a stable win.',
        )}</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="abstract-row">
      <span class="abstract-label bottleneck">{t('接下来', 'What remains')}</span>
      <div class="abstract-copy">
        <p class="plain">{t(
          '我们已经按 SEED 公开代码把“首次验证”对应的 128 个任务槽位重建出来，而且两次干净重建得到完全一致的任务清单。现在还不能直接跑正式比较：下一关是先证明服务器实际运行时看到的就是这 128 个任务，再单独授权正式 GPU 评测。',
          'We have now rebuilt the 128 task slots corresponding to the released SEED code’s first validation, and two clean rebuilds produced the same manifest. Formal comparison still cannot start directly: the next gate is to prove that the server runtime sees those same 128 tasks, followed by a separate release for formal GPU evaluation.',
        )}</p>
        <p class="technical"><strong>{t('专业解释：', 'Technical detail: ')}</strong>{t(
          '128 个源码忠实任务槽位（source-faithful task slots）已经物化并通过双重重建校验；当前状态仍是 PREPARED，formal task consumption 尚未授权。下一步是 128/128 runtime semantic validation，再通过独立 activation/release。BASE 与 OpenEvo SD-LoRA 保持冻结，多代连续改进也仍未建立。',
          'The 128 source-faithful task slots are materialized and have passed two matching clean rebuilds. The state remains PREPARED and formal task consumption is not authorized. Next comes 128/128 runtime semantic validation, followed by a separate activation/release. BASE and OpenEvo SD-LoRA remain frozen, and stable multi-generation improvement is still not established.',
        )}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="cutoff-note">
    <strong>{t('证据时间边界', 'Evidence cutoff')}</strong>
    <span>{t(
      '机制结论截至 H1.41。H1.42 是之后的测量校准记录（measurement calibration）；2026-08-25 的 SEED 保留范围复测和之后物化的 source-faithful 128-slot 面板属于另外两层证据，不会被倒过来混进 H1.41 的机制结论。',
      'Mechanism conclusions are cut off at H1.41. H1.42 is a later measurement-calibration record; the 2026-08-25 SEED-range rerun and the later materialized source-faithful 128-slot panel are separate evidence layers and are not blended backward into the H1.41 mechanism conclusions.',
    )}</span>
  </div>

  <nav class="paper-nav" aria-label={t('研究结果导航', 'Research results navigation')}>
    {navItems.map((item) => <a href={item.href}>{item.label}</a>)}
  </nav>
</header>

<style>
  .results-hero{max-width:1160px;margin:0 auto;padding:36px 24px 12px;color:var(--color-text)}
  .eyebrow{margin:0 0 18px;color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:.75rem;font-weight:750;letter-spacing:.12em}
  .results-hero h1{margin:0;max-width:940px;font-size:clamp(2.35rem,5vw,4.35rem);line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:-.05em}
  .lede{max-width:800px;margin:22px 0 0;color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:1.02rem;line-height:1.75}
  .abstract-box{max-width:960px;margin-top:30px;border-block:2px solid var(--color-text)}
  .abstract-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:150px minmax(0,1fr);gap:20px;padding:18px 0}.abstract-row+.abstract-row{border-top:1px solid var(--color-border)}
  .abstract-label{font-size:.74rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.04em;line-height:1.7}.abstract-label.established{color:var(--color-accent)}.abstract-label.latest{color:var(--color-info)}.abstract-label.bottleneck{color:var(--color-text-muted)}
  .abstract-copy{display:grid;gap:8px}.abstract-copy p{margin:0;max-width:76ch;line-height:1.72}.abstract-copy .plain{font-size:.94rem;color:var(--color-text)}.abstract-copy .technical{padding-top:7px;border-top:1px dashed var(--color-border);color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:.8rem}.abstract-copy .technical strong{color:var(--color-text);font-weight:760}
  .cutoff-note{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:baseline;flex-wrap:wrap;max-width:960px;margin-top:20px;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border);font-size:.8rem}.cutoff-note strong{color:var(--color-accent)}.cutoff-note span{max-width:80ch;color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.6}
  .paper-nav{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.45rem 1.3rem;max-width:960px;margin-top:22px;padding:1rem 0;border-block:1px solid var(--color-border)}.paper-nav a{color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:.78rem;font-weight:720;text-decoration:none;text-underline-offset:.2em}.paper-nav a:hover,.paper-nav a:focus-visible{color:var(--color-text);text-decoration:underline}
  @media(max-width:720px){.results-hero{padding:24px 18px 8px}.abstract-row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:6px}}
</style>
